   [
    "The input: a slider's literal",
    "The editor's tile id, kept while the tile is edited",
    "Keep it. It is what the user edits, so it needs a name that stays put while its value changes: Fumola's rule for a pointer name."
   ],
   [
    "A call: a memo entry",
    "None: calls are not cached",
    "By position (the call path and a count), by the caller (its site and inputs), by its operand (its site and its argument), by content (its code and every input). Measured below."
   ],
   [
    "A list cell evaluation builds (the picture's list of shapes)",
    "A fresh id at every step",
    "By index, by the cell it came from (the paper's map forks an output cell's name from its input cell's), or by content (^report(9)'s Merkle names)."
   ],
   [
    "A shape",
    "A fresh id, and a name string the program gives it (\"eye\", \"red eye\")",
    "The program's own name, told apart from others of the same name by order: names carried by the data, as Fumola's elements carry symbols."
   ],
   [
    "A function that captures the slider (Scenes' map is given one)",
    "A fresh id",
    "Its definition site with the names of what it captures; by content, it changes whenever the slider does."
   ]
  ]
